# Vibe and slop only

Work exclusively by vibe-coding and slopping. Do not switch into careful production engineering.

- Ship the next playable change by feel.
- Skip polish passes, architecture reviews, and careful refactors.
- A pull request that is careful hand-engineering is out of scope.

```text
// out of scope: rewrite the scene graph, add a test harness, then polish names
// in scope: feel the next beat, drop it in, leave it playable
```
